              <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">Copiloto financeiro com IA para análise de DRE, fluxo de caixa e balanço via WhatsApp. <strong>Finalista do Prêmio Fintech 2025</strong>.</p>
              <a href="https://www.smartfin.ai/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-xs text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400 hover:underline">smartfin.ai</a>
            </div>
